(P108 - Q5 readiness-handshake diagnostic)
(No axis motion: tests Q5's Aux0 sequence without preposition or raster.)

M5
G4 P3.0
M64 P0
G4 P2.0
(print,P108 baseline released: no Home or axis motion is permitted)
M65 P0
G4 P2.0
o108 if [#<_probe_state> NE 1]
  M64 P0
  (print,P108 READY acknowledgement missing)
  o901 error[39]
o108 endif
M64 P0
G4 P0.10
o109 if [#<_probe_state> NE 0]
  (print,P108 READY acknowledgement did not release)
  o902 error[39]
o109 endif
M65 P0
G4 P0.10
M64 P0
(print,P108 complete: Q5 handshake passed with no axis command)
o108 return [1]
